Error [E2702]: Crypto API misuse
  --> tests/ui/crypto_hkdf_output_length.jet:8:49
    |
  8 |     safe :: crypto.hkdf_sha256([U8]{1}, [], [], ((8161)))
    |                                                 ^^^^^^^^
 Why: The output length is 8161, and `hkdf_sha256` takes 0..8160, so the call can only fail
 Fix: Replace the offending cryptographic argument with the concrete value or bound named in the diagnostic: pass an output length of 0..8160
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2702

Error [E2702]: Crypto API misuse
