 10 |         raw :: expert.hkdf_sha256_raw([1], [], [], ((-1)))
    |                                                    ^^^^^^
 Why: The output length is -1, and `hkdf_sha256_raw` takes 0..8160, so the call can only fail
 Fix: Replace the offending cryptographic argument with the concrete value or bound named in the diagnostic: pass an output length of 0..8160
